      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.74 (vs ₹2.28 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.74 (down from ₹2.28 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹4.86b (up 4.6% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹283.0m (down 24% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.8% (down from 8.0% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 6% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 12% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
